{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11301350","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11301350","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1130135001:1":{"text":"세일린워터 마을이라고 들어봤나?","source_cn":"咸水镇，听说过吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1378252B70010E04","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130135002:1":{"text":"세일린워터 사람들은 거칠다고 들었는데, 거기서 무슨 문제라도 생길까 봐 걱정이 이만저만이 아니야.","source_cn":"据说那个镇子的民风彪悍，我真担心到了那里遇到什么问题。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D1C594DE3C14B81","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130135003:1":{"text":"하지만 돈 버는 일이 다 그렇지 뭐. 모든 거래가 다 완벽할 수는 없으니까.","source_cn":"不过赚钱就是这样，你不可能要求每单生意都万无一失。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x99F26D583FEBFA25","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1130135004:1":{"text":"그 뭐더라, “모래 폭풍이 거친 사막일수록 사막의 가죽은 더욱더 비싸다”라는 말도 있잖아.","source_cn":"那句话怎么说来着，“荒漠上的沙暴越大，荒漠的皮毛就越贵”。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9CF85CE51E44A748","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:商人塔林塔":{"text":"상인 탈린","source":"商人塔林塔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}